{"3651370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sombie", "steam_appid": 3651370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet new friends, or don't...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>This game is always online. We recommend befriending other players along the way to survive together. If you would rather shoot them and take their loot for yourself, you have that option. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In towns you can enter houses and find food, weapons, and ammo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/e7c74b501ca10a216a005b9c4ebbdf76.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/e7c74b501ca10a216a005b9c4ebbdf76.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/e7c74b501ca10a216a005b9c4ebbdf76.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a camp</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut down trees, gather materials, and build a home to call your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/371b716cf2283ba1ff7640aee4e0fa9a.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/371b716cf2283ba1ff7640aee4e0fa9a.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/371b716cf2283ba1ff7640aee4e0fa9a.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars are an excellent weapon, and transportation, but be careful, cars may break and need repair</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/89264423055c0657660894a34ba7af8d.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/89264423055c0657660894a34ba7af8d.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/89264423055c0657660894a34ba7af8d.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the constant action? go do something more relaxing. Go fishing, fish is a good source of food, or you can sell it to merchants in order to buy what you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/20f33ea5ddef20d5c0a24895a5102dc6.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/20f33ea5ddef20d5c0a24895a5102dc6.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/20f33ea5ddef20d5c0a24895a5102dc6.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight off the hoard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoards of zombies will chase you if you get near, or make too much noise. You can fight them off with weapons, but beware, shooting brings attention from both players and sombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/2d893d38ca0121137a9d6a9646fb66ca.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/2d893d38ca0121137a9d6a9646fb66ca.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/2d893d38ca0121137a9d6a9646fb66ca.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite world</strong> <br>The world is generated as you, or others explore. There is no edge to the universe of Sombie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP / PvE</strong><br>Hoards of zombies will chase you if you get near, or make too much noise. You can fight them off with weapons, but beware, shooting brings attention from both players and sombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L</strong>oot<br>In towns you can enter houses and find food, weapons, and ammo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat</strong><br>There is both global and local chat. Global broadcasts your message to the entire server. Local lets you communicate only with nearby players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice chat</strong>There is local voice chat, if you are near  another player and you have a microphone you can speak to them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And many more things to come...</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet new friends, or don't...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>This game is always online. We recommend befriending other players along the way to survive together. If you would rather shoot them and take their loot for yourself, you have that option. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In towns you can enter houses and find food, weapons, and ammo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/e7c74b501ca10a216a005b9c4ebbdf76.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/e7c74b501ca10a216a005b9c4ebbdf76.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/e7c74b501ca10a216a005b9c4ebbdf76.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a camp</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut down trees, gather materials, and build a home to call your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/371b716cf2283ba1ff7640aee4e0fa9a.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/371b716cf2283ba1ff7640aee4e0fa9a.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/371b716cf2283ba1ff7640aee4e0fa9a.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars are an excellent weapon, and transportation, but be careful, cars may break and need repair</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/89264423055c0657660894a34ba7af8d.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/89264423055c0657660894a34ba7af8d.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/89264423055c0657660894a34ba7af8d.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the constant action? go do something more relaxing. Go fishing, fish is a good source of food, or you can sell it to merchants in order to buy what you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/20f33ea5ddef20d5c0a24895a5102dc6.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/20f33ea5ddef20d5c0a24895a5102dc6.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/20f33ea5ddef20d5c0a24895a5102dc6.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight off the hoard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoards of zombies will chase you if you get near, or make too much noise. You can fight them off with weapons, but beware, shooting brings attention from both players and sombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/2d893d38ca0121137a9d6a9646fb66ca.poster.avif?t=1788114029\" width=1168 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/2d893d38ca0121137a9d6a9646fb66ca.webm?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/extras/2d893d38ca0121137a9d6a9646fb66ca.mp4?t=1788114029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite world</strong> <br>The world is generated as you, or others explore. There is no edge to the universe of Sombie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP / PvE</strong><br>Hoards of zombies will chase you if you get near, or make too much noise. You can fight them off with weapons, but beware, shooting brings attention from both players and sombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L</strong>oot<br>In towns you can enter houses and find food, weapons, and ammo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat</strong><br>There is both global and local chat. Global broadcasts your message to the entire server. Local lets you communicate only with nearby players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice chat</strong>There is local voice chat, if you are near  another player and you have a microphone you can speak to them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And many more things to come...</strong></p>", "short_description": "Sombie offers action packed PvP, and PvE in an always online MMO. loot, kill, die, repeat. Explore an endless randomly generated world with your friends. Offering a unique spin on the Zombie survival genre, built from the ground up.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651370/8f28cc3115ee0c7d5f1c8c9643fc1ad835bd7bf8/header.jpg?t=1788114029", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it